<title>USA: Norfolk Southern withdraws Conrail motion.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Southern withdraws Conrail motion.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp wiithdrew its motion for an expedited appeal of a U.S. district court ruling that allowed CSX Corp to buy 19.9 percent of Conrail Inc shares.</p>
<p>In papers filed with the Third U.S. Circuit Court of Appeals in Philadelphia, Norfolk Southern said an expedited appeal was no longer necessary following the midnight expiration of CSX's tender offer to buy the Conrail shares.</p>
</text>
